{"ID":"20240522082245-5i7yilc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082245-5i7yilc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082245-5i7yilc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522094409-mutxf72\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522094409-01yj2ez\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522094409-6a8nwao\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:5\u0026#125;","title":"孟超的升麻鱉甲湯案例","type":"doc","updated":"20240522094607"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522094409-mutxf72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-mutxf72","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【升麻鱉甲湯案例】一、（廱症）"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-auctuf2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-auctuf2","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3-25-09"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-6o6x96y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-6o6x96y","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M.A.男性，52歲，身高6尺3寸、體重220磅，人高馬大的壯碩男子，平日喜肥甘厚味，大魚大肉，天天吃牛排，近一個月來，因左大腿根部，近外生殖器及臀部之間，長了一大腫塊，大小約15㎝×5㎝×3㎝，色紅略紫，痛而發熱，硬如石塊，不能碰觸，因此坐立難安，連睡覺都只能趴著睡，為此幾乎天天失眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-vsqvqv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-vsqvqv6","updated":"20240522094420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"查其飲食二便皆正常，手足溫，舌黃而厚膩，望診面現黑氣，診斷為廱瘍。患者問我能治嗎？西醫要他手術，但其姊力勸以中醫診治，我告慰他說：雖然症劇，但此屬陽症，反而易治，不用擔心。遂令患者站立，於左委中附近，膨脹之青色靜脈處，針刺五處放血，放出之血皆黑而黏稠，約50cc.，色轉紅而停；並針刺二白穴及承山穴深剌至骨，採瀉法。處方【真人活命飲加紫草根、丹皮】，並囑飲食清淡，不可吃肉。他問我，不吃肉，吃海鮮可以嗎？我回答：當然不可以。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（心想，怪不得他要得此病。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-8guvllo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-8guvllo","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3-27-09來診告知，更加灼熱而疼痛，囑其加大一倍劑量續服，並配合外用葯【芒硝、青黛、乳香、沒藥、槐角、紅花、川芎、白芷各20克】煎湯熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-w6zvzht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-w6zvzht","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3-31-09痛略減輕，但腫塊絲毫未變，仍硬如石。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-p681w2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-p681w2o","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"改弦易轍，投金匱方【升麻鱉甲丸日3次，一次10丸】"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-x9j302r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-x9j302r","updated":"20240522094525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"註："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"升麻鱉甲丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：【升麻2炙鱉甲3當歸2生甘草2雄黃0.5蜀椒1（炒去汗）】蜜丸，如小豆。此丸完全按升麻別甲湯，原方組成比例制成丸劑。（原方治陰陽毒，歷代醫家爭論不休，認為陽毒應去雄黃、蜀椒，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"臨床證實，倪師說法才正確，治陽毒，不去雄黃、蜀椒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）制成丸劑，易於掌控雄黃劑量。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（原方原治陰陽毒，除案例治症外，對於淋巴腫大，紅斑狼瘡，甲狀腺腫大，乳廱，無名腫痛，及某些皮膚炎症色紅成斑者，都有使用的機會，關鍵在於毒字。另，在易巨蓀先生的集思醫案，更以此方為散劑，治癒疫病大流行，救人無數。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-kge7nii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-kge7nii","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4-3-09患者自訴，服葯兩天後，痛大為減輕，可以坐下了，腫塊剩下三分之一，面部黑氣一掃而空，乘勝追擊，處方【無言廱疔丸】日服半粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-xbr48h1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-xbr48h1","updated":"20240522094541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"註："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"無言廱疔丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：【大黃1雄黃1巴豆（去皮殼）1】（有機米醋）醋糊丸如小豆。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（此方取自倪師推崇之余無言先生的醫案，原名疔瘡丸，為清朝盧成琰氏所創，無言先生治一切廱毒、癤腫，百發百中，為紀念余無言先生之功，遂冠其名，無言廱疔丸。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-7tktppn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-7tktppn","updated":"20240522094553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※由此二方可知"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"雄黃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解毒辟穢之力神。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-q1ou6ki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-q1ou6ki","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4-7-09日瀉四、五回，痛除，行住坐臥自得，腫塊剩下十分之一，唯人感稍虛，查舌苔轉白而濕。處方【升麻鱉甲丸日3次，一次5丸】合【朮附湯加真人活命飲】，鞏固療效，一星期後告知癒。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-461pedw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-461pedw","updated":"20240522094409"}},{"ID":"20240522094409-ts8c8hy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-ts8c8hy","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【升麻鱉甲湯案例】二、（毒虫咬傷）"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-x9kaypw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-x9kaypw","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4-21-09"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-ndz9ymw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-ndz9ymw","updated":"20240522094435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"A.A.女性，54歲，三天前在公園手背被毒蟲咬，紅腫熱痛，第一天腫至手腕，第二天到腕上兩寸，第三天上至手肘，腫到手指無法彎曲，原手臂約莫大了三倍，好像小叮噹的手一般，昨夜手灼熱而全身發冷，自覺即將暈厥，差一點要送急診。二日前在家中自行用灸法，無寸效，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（怕警鈴響，只能用無煙艾灸，大概力弱，故無效；多數情形炙法效佳，請見倪師人紀針灸DVD。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-ec14mkb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-ec14mkb","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"查脈虛，苔薄白潤，手足不溫，怕冷，足輕微水腫，只見整肢手皮膚脹的發亮，色紅，觸之發熱，手背處清晰可見虫咬的兩個小洞。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-wkplxwx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-wkplxwx","updated":"20240522094532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方【升麻鱉甲丸日3次，一次10丸】合【真武湯重用炮附、白朮加澤瀉、紅藤、銀花、連翹】"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（內含朮附湯，乃倪師喜用之排膿袪濕聖藥）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-qw0d0rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-qw0d0rw","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4-24-09服藥一天腫退一半，第三天癒。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-9b8a4or","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-9b8a4or","updated":"20240522094409"}},{"ID":"20240522094409-3xnp99n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-3xnp99n","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【升麻鱉甲湯案例】三、（帶狀皰疹）"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-lt3k5by","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-lt3k5by","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    5-5-09"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-0znxg71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-0znxg71","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M.S.女性，40歲，三天前開始右季脅後方處痛，初以為扭傷，檢查後發現痛處有一簇密集的小水皰，局部皮膚泛紅，並有灼熱感，轉腰牽拉則痛劇，半夜睡時因為癢而搔抓則痛醒，我告知她是帶狀皰疹而非扭傷。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-nq308gx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-nq308gx","updated":"20240522094600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"斷為陽毒，處方【升麻鱉甲丸日3次，一次10丸】合【小柴胡湯（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"引經藥"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）加全蝎、蜈蚣】全蝎、蜈蚣已入膠囊，一方面不嚇倒病人，另一方面省去腥臭難嚥的氣味。並外塗漢唐HT-18，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"另一法，棉花燒灼術，請見倪師人紀針灸DVD，屬最廉價效佳之法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（全蝎乃倪師治療帶狀皰疹必用之良藥）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-cb8djmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-cb8djmx","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"隔日灼痛銳減，第三日結痂，紅色退，只剩下癢，已近痊癒，只待結痂脫落，即告大成。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-utxg0bq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-utxg0bq","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"學生張孟超報告    5-11-09"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-8nc4y4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-8nc4y4q","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-6a8nwao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-6a8nwao","updated":"20240522094607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"　"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-ifwzq74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-ifwzq74","updated":"20240522094501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孟超不愧為我的優秀學生之一，光是以這篇陽毒的案例為準的話，世上能超越過孟超的中醫師，已經是曲指可數了，近聞我其他在加州的學生跟我言及於目前在加州開業的中醫師中，說加州民間有句俗諺說，[ 南孟超，北明煌。] 可見我這兩位學生除了有著過人的實力，必然還有視病如親的醫療態度，時常不厭其煩的為病人解說，對病人的態度非常有耐心，真是不可多得的中醫，老師以他為榮。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-yr88u2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-yr88u2r","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    我最痛恨一種中醫，將病人的自尊踩在腳底下，只知謾罵病人，不知體恤病人，這種惡質的中醫，不要也罷。我也時常罵病人，但是我的罵，卻會讓病人破涕為笑，離開時從一開始的沮喪都變成滿懷信心與希望，我痛恨不正確的西醫學，所以我只罵錯誤的西醫學，也會罵迷信西醫學的笨蛋，但是都是出於想救病人的心態之下才會開口罵，絕對不會謾罵一通，讓病人完全沒有自尊，這是不對的做法，希望同道共勉之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-s8ks1a7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-s8ks1a7","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522094409-01yj2ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094409-01yj2ez","updated":"20240522094409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2009年05月16日"}]}]}